WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.470
- You know the details?

00:00:01.470 --> 00:00:02.810
You know the philosophy?

00:00:02.810 --> 00:00:04.820
Don't worry about about all
the minutiae in the middle.

00:00:04.820 --> 00:00:07.126
The politics, the process.

00:00:07.126 --> 00:00:10.230
All the crap that does not matter.

00:00:10.230 --> 00:00:11.922
And that's it, I spend all my time

00:00:11.922 --> 00:00:13.890
in the clouds and the dirt.

00:00:13.890 --> 00:00:17.220
Mindset and execution, clouds and dirt,

00:00:17.220 --> 00:00:18.163
clouds and dirt.

00:02:15.585 --> 00:02:18.252
(heart beating)

